<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Resumo Executivo — Queda UNIGAL</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/xlsx@0.18.5/dist/xlsx.full.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.0/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chartjs-plugin-datalabels@2.2.0/dist/chartjs-plugin-datalabels.min.js"></script>
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #F8FAFC; --panel: #FFFFFF; --line: #E2E8F0; --line-strong: #CBD5E1;
  --ink: #0F172A; --sub: #475569; --faint: #64748B;
  --accent: #0D9488; --accent-dark: #0F766E; --accent-dim: #F0FDFA; --accent-line: #99F6E4;
  --alert: #DC2626; --good: #16A34A;
  --mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; --sans: 'IBM Plex Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
body {
  background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  padding: 28px 20px 40px;
}
.sheet { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; }

.topbar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 18px; }
.brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
.brand .mark { width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 3px; background: var(--accent); }
.brand h1 { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.brand .sub { font-size: 12px; color: var(--sub); margin-top: 2px; }
.topbar-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
.btn-print {
  background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px 16px;
  font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
}
.btn-print:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); }
.btn-upload {
  background: #FFFFFF; color: var(--accent-dark); border: 1px solid var(--accent-line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px 16px;
  font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
}
.btn-upload:hover { background: var(--accent-dim); }
#fileInputExec { display: none; }
.src-note-exec {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; background: var(--panel-raised);
  border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 7px; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 11px; font-family: var(--mono);
  color: var(--sub); margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.restore-link-exec { background: none; border: none; color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; }

.period-bar {
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 10px 0; margin-bottom: 20px;
  border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 12px; color: var(--sub);
}
.period-bar b { color: var(--ink); }
.cloud-status { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; margin-left: 4px; }
.cloud-status.cloud { color: var(--accent-dark); }
.cloud-status.local { color: var(--faint); }
.cloud-status.saving { color: #B45309; }
.cloud-status.error { color: var(--alert); }

.kpi-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
.kpi-row-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
.kpi {
  background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 20px;
  border-top: 3px solid var(--line-strong);
}
.kpi.hero { border-top-color: var(--accent); background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--accent-dim), #fff 60%); }
.kpi .k { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--sub); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.03em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.kpi .v { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1; }
.kpi .v.money { color: var(--accent-dark); }
.kpi .trend { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 10px; }
.kpi .trend.up { color: var(--alert); } .kpi .trend.down { color: var(--good); } .kpi .trend.flat { color: var(--faint); }
.kpi .note { font-size: 11px; color: var(--faint); margin-top: 8px; }

.row-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
.card { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 20px; }
.card-title { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
.card-title .unit { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--faint); font-weight: 500; }
.chart-wrap { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 210px; }

.rank-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.rank-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
.rank-pos { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--faint); width: 16px; flex: none; }
.rank-body { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.rank-name { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 4px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.rank-bar-bg { background: var(--line); border-radius: 4px; height: 7px; overflow: hidden; }
.rank-bar-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 4px; }
.rank-item { cursor: pointer; border-radius: 6px; padding: 3px 4px; margin: -3px -4px; transition: background .12s; }
.rank-item:hover { background: #F1F5F9; }
.rank-item.selected .rank-name { color: var(--accent-dark); font-weight: 700; }
.rank-item.dimmed { opacity: .4; }

.rank-filter-chip {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px;
  background: #ECFDF5; border: 1px solid #A7F3D0; border-radius: 7px; padding: 8px 13px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink);
}
.rank-filter-chip b { color: var(--accent-dark); }
.rank-filter-chip button { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border: none; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
.rank-val { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); flex: none; text-align: right; width: 90px; }
.rank-pct { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; color: var(--faint); flex: none; text-align: right; width: 38px; }

.footer-note { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--faint); margin-top: 22px; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); line-height: 1.6; }
.footer-note b { color: var(--sub); }

.sec-divider { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin: 34px 0 16px; }
.sec-divider::before, .sec-divider::after { content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--line-strong); }
.sec-divider span { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--sub); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; white-space: nowrap; }

.filters-row-exec { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.filter-hint-exec { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--faint); margin-bottom: 20px; }
.ishi-nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.ishi-nav-btn {
  width: 32px; height: 32px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 7px;
  color: var(--ink); font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
}
.ishi-nav-btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
.ishi-nav-btn[disabled] { opacity: .35; cursor: default; }
.ishi-nav-pos { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--sub); }
.filters-row-exec select {
  background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans);
  font-size: 12.5px; padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: 7px; outline: none; flex: 1 1 220px;
}
.filters-row-exec select:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }

.ishi-wrap { position: relative; padding: 8px 0; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.ishi-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 14px; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
.ishi-row.top { margin-bottom: 36px; } .ishi-row.bottom { margin-top: 36px; }
.ishi-spine { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 50%; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--line-strong) 4%, var(--line-strong) 96%, var(--accent)); z-index: 1; }
.ishi-card { background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 13px 15px; }
.ishi-card .lead { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 8px; padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); text-transform: uppercase; }
.ishi-card dl { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
.ishi-card .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; }
.ishi-card dt { font-size: 11px; color: var(--sub); } .ishi-card dd { font-size: 12px; font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); text-align: right; }
.ishi-card-alert { background: #FEF2F2; border: 1px solid #FECACA; border-left: 4px solid var(--alert); }
.ishi-anom-list { max-height: 150px; overflow-y: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
.ishi-anom-item { display: flex; gap: 7px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #FECACA; border-radius: 5px; padding: 6px 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.35; }
.ishi-anom-cod { flex: none; background: var(--alert); color: #fff; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px; }
.ishi-core { position: relative; z-index: 3; max-width: 420px; margin: -20px auto 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 2px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 18px; text-align: center; }
.ishi-core .tag { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; }
.ishi-core .title { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-top: 3px; }
.ishi-core .sub { font-size: 11px; color: var(--sub); margin-top: 4px; font-family: var(--mono); }
.ishi-empty { text-align: center; padding: 40px 20px; color: var(--faint); font-size: 13px; }
@media (max-width: 760px) { .ishi-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; } .ishi-row.top, .ishi-row.bottom { margin: 0; } .ishi-spine { display: none; } .ishi-core { margin: 14px auto; } }

.note-section-exec { margin-top: 20px; }
.note-head-exec { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--sub); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 9px; }
.note-area-exec {
  width: 100%; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px dashed var(--line-strong); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans);
  font-size: 13px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px; resize: vertical; min-height: 70px; outline: none; line-height: 1.5;
}
.note-area-exec:focus { border-color: var(--accent); border-style: solid; }
.note-view-exec { background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.55; white-space: pre-wrap; }
.note-actions-exec { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 10px; }
.note-btn-exec { background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 7px 15px; border-radius: 7px; cursor: pointer; }
.note-btn-exec:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
.note-btn-exec.primary { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
.note-btn-exec.primary:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); }
.note-btn-exec.danger { color: var(--alert); }
.note-btn-exec.danger:hover { border-color: var(--alert); background: #FEF2F2; }
.note-btn-exec.add { background: transparent; border: 1px dashed var(--line-strong); color: var(--sub); width: 100%; text-align: left; }
.note-btn-exec.add:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--ink); }

.modal-backdrop {
  display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.65); backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
  z-index: 9999; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px;
}
.modal-backdrop.open { display: flex; }
.modal-box {
  background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 10px; max-width: 680px; width: 100%; max-height: 85vh;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #CBD5E1;
}
.modal-head { padding: 16px 20px; background: #F8FAFC; border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
.modal-body { padding: 18px 20px; overflow-y: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
.occ-detail-card { background: #F8FAFC; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 14px; }
.occ-detail-card.has-anom { border-left-color: var(--alert); }
.occ-detail-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr)); gap: 6px 10px; margin-top: 8px; }
.occ-detail-item { font-size: 11px; }
.occ-detail-item .k { color: var(--sub); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1px; }
.occ-detail-item .v { color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 600; }
.occ-detail-anoms { margin-top: 9px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
.occ-detail-anom { font-size: 10.5px; display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: flex-start; }
.occ-detail-anom .cod { flex: none; background: var(--alert); color: #fff; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 3px; }
.occ-detail-gotovol { margin-top: 10px; width: 100%; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--accent); color: var(--accent-dark); font-weight: 600; font-size: 11px; padding: 6px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; }
.occ-detail-gotovol:hover { background: var(--accent-dim); }

@media print {
  body { background: #fff; padding: 0; }
  .no-print { display: none !important; }
  .sheet { max-width: 100%; }
  .kpi, .card { box-shadow: none; break-inside: avoid; }
}
@media (max-width: 820px) {
  .kpi-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .row-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="sheet">

  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="mark"></div>
      <div>
        <h1>Queda na Laminação</h1>
        <div class="sub">UNIGAL · CGL &nbsp;·&nbsp; Resumo executivo para apresentação</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="topbar-actions no-print">
      <label class="btn-upload" for="fileInputExec">⬆ Carregar planilha</label>
      <input type="file" id="fileInputExec" accept=".xlsx,.xls">
      <button class="btn-print" id="printBtn">⎙ PDF / Imprimir</button>
    </div>
  </div>


  <div class="period-bar">
    <span>Período analisado: <b id="periodoTxt">—</b></span>
    <span>Gerado em <b id="dataGeracao">—</b> <span id="cloudStatusTxt" class="cloud-status"></span></span>
  </div>

  <div class="filters-row-exec no-print">
    <select id="fMesExec"><option value="">Mês (todos)</option></select>
    <select id="fDiaExec"><option value="">Dia (todos)</option></select>
    <select id="fMotivoExec"><option value="">Motivo (todos)</option></select>
    <select id="fVolumeExec"><option value="">Volume (todos)</option></select>
  </div>
  <div class="filter-hint-exec no-print">Os filtros acima controlam a página inteira — números, gráfico, rankings e o diagrama de causa. Clique numa barra dos rankings ou do gráfico semanal pra filtrar também.</div>
  <div class="rank-filter-chip no-print" id="rankFilterChip" style="display:none"></div>

  <div class="kpi-row kpi-row-3">
    <div class="kpi hero">
      <div class="k">Peso total de queda</div>
      <div class="v" id="kpiPeso">—</div>
      <div class="trend" id="kpiPesoTrend"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi">
      <div class="k">Volumes com queda</div>
      <div class="v" id="kpiVolumes">—</div>
      <div class="note" id="kpiVolumesNote"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi">
      <div class="k">Sucatados</div>
      <div class="v" id="kpiEscarf">—</div>
      <div class="note" id="kpiEscarfNote"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row-2">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title"><span>Evolução semanal</span><span class="unit">peso em toneladas</span></div>
      <div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="chartSemana"></canvas></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title"><span>Maiores causas</span><span class="unit">% do peso total</span></div>
      <div class="rank-list" id="rankMotivo"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row-2">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title"><span>Clientes mais afetados</span><span class="unit">peso (t)</span></div>
      <div class="rank-list" id="rankCliente"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title"><span>Setor destino</span><span class="unit">peso (t)</span></div>
      <div class="rank-list" id="rankSetor"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row-2">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title"><span>Local da queda</span><span class="unit">peso (t)</span></div>
      <div class="rank-list" id="rankLinha"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title"><span>Enquadramento (tipo de qualidade)</span><span class="unit">peso (t)</span></div>
      <div class="rank-list" id="rankLinhaRetrab"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:18px;">
    <div class="card-title"><span>Evolução diária</span><span class="unit">peso em toneladas por dia — clique num ponto para ver as ocorrências</span></div>
    <div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="chartDiario"></canvas></div>
  </div>

  <div class="sec-divider"><span>Diagrama de causa — ocorrência em destaque</span></div>
  <div class="ishi-nav no-print">
    <button class="ishi-nav-btn" id="ishiPrevBtn">‹</button>
    <span class="ishi-nav-pos" id="ishiNavPos">—</span>
    <button class="ishi-nav-btn" id="ishiNextBtn">›</button>
  </div>
  <div class="ishi-wrap" id="ishiBoxExec"></div>
  <div class="note-section-exec" id="noteSectionExec"></div>


</div>

<div class="modal-backdrop" id="dayModalBackdrop">
  <div class="modal-box">
    <div class="modal-head">
      <div>
        <h3 id="dayModalTitle" style="font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#0F172A; margin:0;"></h3>
        <p id="dayModalSub" style="font-size:11.5px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; font-family:var(--mono);"></p>
      </div>
      <button id="dayModalCloseBtn" style="background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #CBD5E1; border-radius:6px; width:30px; height:30px; cursor:pointer; font-weight:700; color:#475569;">✕</button>
    </div>
    <div id="dayModalBody" class="modal-body"></div>
  </div>
